eo/graph_edges.py, eo/knowledge_graph.py, eo/source_index.py,
eo/memory_batch.py, eo/note_candidates.py had zero test coverage.
First 5 of the 10 remaining content/knowledge modules from patch 7e.

- graph_edges: create_edge guard rails, workspace scoping, JSON-file
  store round-trip.
- knowledge_graph: write/get/delete/rename/search/list_nodes against
  a fake Upstash Vector index; embed/upsert/query failure -> degrade
  postures.
- source_index: topic-skeleton trim + covers derivation, depth-
  adaptive parent-tree walk (get_packet_depth), scope validation.
- memory_batch: Postgres-backed batch CRUD, ownership filtering,
  mutual member sync, last-member-standing dissolution.
- note_candidates: propose/accept/reject-by-id (bug-audit §9
  regression pin), write_node degrade posture, fire-and-forget
  notification/cache-invalidation failure isolation.

161 new tests, all passing. Full suite: 1173 passed, 7 skipped
(4 pre-existing unrelated integration failures - missing spaCy model
download, blocked by network policy in this sandbox; unaffected by
this patch).
